35:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"sr-tradeoff","className":"rounded-3xl border border-[#16A34A]/15 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"sr-tradeoff","className":"font-heading flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-bold","children":[["$","$L2e",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M12 3v18","key":"108xh3"}],["path",{"d":"m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7","key":"zcdpyk"}],["path",{"d":"M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1","key":"1yorad"}],["path",{"d":"m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7","key":"eua70x"}],["path",{"d":"M7 21h10","key":"1b0cd5"}]],"className":"lucide-scale h-5 w-5 text-[#16A34A]","aria-hidden":true}]," ","Should you drive or fly from Jeddah to Dammam?"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","style":{"maxWidth":"70ch"},"children":[["$","p","For one or two people with normal luggage, flying is usually the better choice. The flight is a fraction of the road time, and we can simply arrange the airport transfers at each end. We would rather tell you that than sell you a 14-hour drive you do not need.",{"children":"For one or two people with normal luggage, flying is usually the better choice. The flight is a fraction of the road time, and we can simply arrange the airport transfers at each end. We would rather tell you that than sell you a 14-hour drive you do not need."}],["$","p","A private car makes sense when the flight does not: a family moving house with more bags than an airline allows, travellers who cannot or prefer not to fly, a group that wants to stay together in one vehicle, or a trip with stops on the way in Taif or Riyadh. You pay for the vehicle, not per seat, so the cost is shared across everyone travelling.",{"children":"A private car makes sense when the flight does not: a family moving house with more bags than an airline allows, travellers who cannot or prefer not to fly, a group that wants to stay together in one vehicle, or a trip with stops on the way in Taif or Riyadh. You pay for the vehicle, not per seat, so the cost is shared across everyone travelling."}],["$","p","Tell us what you are carrying and how many of you are travelling, and we will say honestly whether one long day, a two-day trip with a night in Riyadh, or a flight with transfers fits you best.",{"children":"Tell us what you are carrying and how many of you are travelling, and we will say honestly whether one long day, a two-day trip with a night in Riyadh, or a flight with transfers fits you best."}]]}]]}]
